    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_g_04_question_04",
      "hash64": "88FCFB183C862810",
      "text": "４　隆志希望寶可夢能在對戰中主動\\n　　使用道具，因此讓牠攜帶橙橙果。\\n　　這麼做是否正確？\\n\\n・正確　・不正確",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
